# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Server-side notification triggers (Edge Function secrets)
# Set these as SECRETS in your external Supabase project
# (Project Settings → Edge Functions → Secrets). Values below are
# reference names only — never commit real service credentials.
#   FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT  full service-account JSON (send-push)
#   FCM_PROJECT_ID            firebase project id
#   FCM_API_KEY               firebase web api key
#   FCM_AUTH_DOMAIN           firebase auth domain
#   FCM_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID   firebase sender id
#   FCM_APP_ID                firebase app id
#   FCM_STORAGE_BUCKET        firebase storage bucket
#   FCM_VAPID_KEY             web push VAPID public key
#   SUPABASE_URL              project url (auto-provided)
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY service role key (auto-provided)
# The DB trigger notify_user_on_new_message() reads SUPABASE_URL and
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY from Vault — create them once with
# select vault.create_secret('<value>', '<name>');
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
